    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Timothy Thompson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107168944690438233677/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJv0tjQ78QbmHDlL-Xnzxa8d5s8xnlLNiHvvcVOzhS1onyRig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I have never had an issue with the clinic. Whenever I call, the receptionist makes an appointment with me. They are kind at the main desk when you arrive. And Dr. Fernando Almonacid is excellent, always on time.",
        "time": 1769187575,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nathalie Meilleur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106154142855092057845/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX2RMnTcyP7YPjYgrA4eYrYJQQrgd7ZCF9C2Z689IczvYkRNI_2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This place is dirty, depressing, full of papers taped on walls, you don’t know where to look and what to read? The personnel ignores you. Not very welcoming. My doctor screams from the hallway your name out, and first thing mentioned when entering the office is that she only has 20 min and that includes typing her notes. The person in charge of the clinic does not return calls when left a message specifically for them when I requested\n“Je souhaite changer de médecin pour des raisons de compatibilité. Est-ce possible de rester inscrite au GMF avec un autre médecin?”",
        "time": 1766086374,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diane Lafricain",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103248036580958944241/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFVWmY0CjN4CcQkzIJETH-Drrn4mty3XA-JQkXDPs2tv4HUg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I have given up on this place. My elderly parents were assigned here after out GP retired. I've been trying to reach them for a month to make an appt for my Father, only to be on hold for a minimum of an hour each time I tried. It doesn't matter what time you try, all the same. There is no message or email option either. I'm forced to bring him, who is 87, to a private clinic, and pay out of pocket, just to get him some care.\nNever again.",
        "time": 1764102344,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Janet Cox",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111115930538653318960/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOPEoAb_RInDAZNxDqWQw7hWMsNG9N5Foclvf4DGIeymFJD8s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Quick appointment, professional informative treatment and the nicest, most caring Doctor I have met in a long time. Reception staff gets 5 stars too, for being very kind and helpful.",
        "time": 1759362775,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dylan Hritchuk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107607045877680452631/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgouaGhoS8yMM1ntBtaOxiT8W2c69qIGoUVFwpR2OLSZ0Wd9OV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "The worst service I have ever received while dealing with doctors. I had to wait 3 MONTHS just to ask my doctor for a blood test request form because my medication is no longer working.\n\nGot my blood work done on the same day, and the clinic calls me back saying they have the results. BUT my doctor will only be available to phone me in 2 MONTHS to give me the results and change my prescription.\n\nThese doctors have absolutely zero compassion and do not care that you suffer for 5-6 months. You're just rushed in and out of appointments while they barely listen to your concerns.\n\nTLDR: If you have a family doctor here, you're better off just waiting the 36 hours in the emergency room at Lakeshore Hospital.",
        "time": 1745616028,
        "translated": false
      }
